1	PRIMARY	<gather1>	NULL	ALL	NULL	NULL	NULL	NULL	1000000	100.00	Parallel execute (4 workers, .derived)
1	SIMPLE	<derived2>	NULL	ALL	NULL	NULL	NULL	NULL	1000000	100.00	NULL
2	DERIVED	<gather2>	NULL	ALL	NULL	NULL	NULL	NULL	100	100.00	Parallel execute (4 workers, pq_test.t1)
2	SIMPLE	t1	NULL	index	NULL	PRIMARY	4	NULL	100	100.00	Using index
2	SIMPLE	t2	NULL	index	NULL	PRIMARY	4	NULL	100	100.00	Using index; Using join buffer (hash join)
2	SIMPLE	t3	NULL	index	NULL	PRIMARY	4	NULL	100	100.00	Using index; Using join buffer (hash join)
Warnings:
Note	1003	/* select#1 */ select sum(`derived`.`prod`) AS `sum(prod)` from (/* select#2 */ select (`pq_test`.`t1`.`id` * `pq_test`.`t2`.`id`) AS `prod` from `pq_test`.`t1` join `pq_test`.`t1` `t2` join `pq_test`.`t1` `t3`) `derived`
